 they'll need to go on a three-day summer training camp to learn the skills they'll need. In the mountains, they experience everything from lectures to field work, and meet the team commander, who seems to have a history with Shirase.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ogbLwIeoTJVTkdkJuqgCrbdzoyy.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Kimari and the others finally have their tickets to Antarctica. However, they'll need to go on a three-day summer training camp to learn the skills they'll need. In the mountains, they experience everything from lectures to field work, and meet the team commander, who seems to have a history with Shirase.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ogbLwIeoTJVTkdkJuqgCrbdzoyy.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13257","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"99426","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35839","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"76059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"337623","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"39294","synopsis":"It's been several months since their training, and the girls' trip to Antarctica is drawing near. With Rin's help, Kimari manages to sort out her luggage, and in doing so, finds a game she borrowed from Megumi a long time ago. When she visits her friend to return it and talk about old times, though, Megumi doesn't seem to remember it at all...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sEq3FULmSKOvHcvfAC5RgHHBnwQ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"It's been several months since their training, and the girls' trip to Antarctica is drawing near. With Rin's help, Kimari manages to sort out her luggage, and in doing so, finds a game she borrowed from Megumi a long